/*=============================================================================
  #Global
==============================================================================*/

#loyaltylion .lion-notification-container{
  font-family: ridley_groteskregular,sans-serif;
}


#loyaltylion .lion-notification-container .lion-action-button--tile{
  line-height: 1.42;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-decoration: none;
  text-align: center;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: all .1s ease-in;
  vertical-align: middle;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  background: #000;
  color: #ffff;
  padding:5px;
  font-size:13px;
}


#loyaltylion .lion-notification-container .lion-action-button--tile:hover{
  border-color:#000;
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification__reward-message{
  margin:0 0 var(--gutter-unit-d2);
  text-align:left;
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification__divider{
  display: none;
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification__icon--points{
  display:none;
}


/*=============================================================================
  #REFERAL
==============================================================================*/
{% comment %}

Found these as a happy accident and had a play, but not completed as it goes outside the scope of the task. 
%his CSS will overide the settings for the post purchase referal prompt @ thank you page.
TODO: replace red placeholder with reference to file + mobile
#loyaltylion .lion-notification.lion-notification--post-purchase-referral.lion-notification--referral-prompt{
  display:flex;
  width:737px;
  max-width:calc(100vw - 24px - 20px);
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification.lion-notification--post-purchase-referral.lion-notification--referral-prompt:after {
  content: '';
  width: 100%;
  background: red;
  display: block;
  width:50%;
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification.lion-notification--post-purchase-referral.lion-notification--referral-prompt .lion-notification__content{
  width:50%;
  min-height:500px;
  justify-content: center;
}

#loyaltylion .lion-notification.lion-notification--post-purchase-referral.lion-notification--referral-prompt .lion-notification__title{
  font-size: var(--t-lxl);
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  text-align: center;
  padding: var(--gutter-unit) 0;
  font-weight: 400;
} 

{% endcomment %}

